1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:03,950
A construction site that runs itself.
Every machine, every decision, on Abenix.

2
00:00:04,050 --> 00:00:08,950
A worker walks into the swing zone.
The safety layer stops the excavator in 4.7 ms.

3
00:00:09,050 --> 00:00:13,550
Seconds later the AI replans the
site and asks a person to approve.

4
00:00:13,650 --> 00:00:18,550
Underneath, 45 machine controllers talk on
real machine buses at 100 times a second.

5
00:00:18,650 --> 00:00:23,550
A gust is forecast. The crane holds.
The plan changes around it.

6
00:00:23,650 --> 00:00:27,150
We switch the AI off. The site stays safe,
because safety never waits for the AI.

7
00:00:27,250 --> 00:00:30,350
The whole site on one screen.
Every number live from Abenix.

8
00:00:31,650 --> 00:00:33,950
AI back on. Agents, models and pipelines return,
and the event log records every change.

9
00:00:35,250 --> 00:00:37,550
Every machine's controllers, live on the bus.
Every J1939 and Sparkplug frame decoded.

10
00:00:38,850 --> 00:00:41,550
Every layer timed in Abenix,
from the twin step to the agents.

11
00:00:41,650 --> 00:00:46,150
A new machine arrives. The AI writes its controller,
tests it, and puts it to work.

12
00:00:46,250 --> 00:00:50,650
Agents earn trust from their record.
Mistakes become lessons a person approves.
